WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.069 --> 00:00:01.270
We lost someone this year,

2
00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:04.040
who was beloved around the world and, especially, here

3
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.011
at Comic-Con and we wanted to do something special

4
00:00:07.011 --> 00:00:09.329
in his memory tonight.

5
00:00:09.329 --> 00:00:10.679
Have a look.

6
00:00:10.679 --> 00:00:12.991
[Narrator] Meanwhile, in the Batcave

7
00:00:12.991 --> 00:00:14.261
(audience cheers and applause)

8
00:00:14.261 --> 00:00:16.160
Hello, Batman speaking.

9
00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:20.327
Some days you just can't get rid of a bomb.

10
00:00:20.527 --> 00:00:23.444
Always inspect a jukebox carefully.

11
00:00:24.698 --> 00:00:27.047
These machines can be deadly.

12
00:00:27.047 --> 00:00:29.607
I knew you'd employ your sneezing powder,

13
00:00:29.607 --> 00:00:32.190
so I took an anti-allergy pill.

14
00:00:33.418 --> 00:00:36.055
Uh oh, better put five cents in the meter.

15
00:00:36.055 --> 00:00:38.258
It's sometimes difficult to think clearly,

16
00:00:38.258 --> 00:00:40.395
when you're strapped to a printing press.

17
00:00:40.395 --> 00:00:41.228
We've come a long way

18
00:00:41.228 --> 00:00:44.308
from the prime minister's exploding cake.

19
00:00:44.308 --> 00:00:46.018
Or have we?

20
00:00:46.018 --> 00:00:47.708
You can't get away from Batman that easy!

21
00:00:47.708 --> 00:00:48.541
Easily.

22
00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:49.476
Easily.

23
00:00:49.476 --> 00:00:51.556
Good grammar is essential, Robin.

24
00:00:51.556 --> 00:00:52.389
Thank you, Batman.

25
00:00:52.389 --> 00:00:53.222
You're welcome.

26
00:00:53.222 --> 00:00:54.696
Where'd you get a live fish, Batman?

27
00:00:54.696 --> 00:00:57.308
A true crime fighter always carries everything he needs

28
00:00:57.308 --> 00:00:59.618
in his utility belt, Robin.

29
00:00:59.618 --> 00:01:02.898
Gosh, Batman, is there anything you don't know?

30
00:01:02.898 --> 00:01:05.287
Oh, yes, Robin, several things, in fact.

31
00:01:05.287 --> 00:01:08.818
They may be drinkers, Robin, but they're also human beings.

32
00:01:08.818 --> 00:01:09.651
To the Batcave!

33
00:01:09.651 --> 00:01:11.058
Via Batcycle to the Batcopter.

34
00:01:11.058 --> 00:01:12.034
To the Batmobile!

35
00:01:12.034 --> 00:01:13.383
To the Batpoles!

36
00:01:13.383 --> 00:01:16.338
I'll do everything I can to rehabilitate you.

37
00:01:16.338 --> 00:01:17.255
Marry me.

38
00:01:18.537 --> 00:01:20.407
Everything, except that!

39
00:01:20.407 --> 00:01:24.324
(audience cheers and applause)

